cial, then at least for SV. By the way, I won't be picking mine up until tomorrow, so you might have put some spoiler notices up, although for those of us who read to solicits, we pretty much could tell what was going to happen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>THWarted","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 09-22-2021, 04:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17984-toby-weingarten","name":"Toby Weingarten","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-22T13:15:30-07:00","id":1460895,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Toby Weingarten</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1460837-winter-s-teeth-10-and-crimson-thaw-1-spoilers?p=1460870#post1460870\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What do you think the chances are that the plot will be made into an &quot;official&quot; supplement for V5? There are so many story hooks available that this all but screams to be into something more. If not official, then at least for SV. By the way, I won't be picking mine up until tomorrow, so you might have put some spoiler notices up, although for those of us who read to solicits, we pretty much could tell what was going to happen.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it will definitely be considered canon by future supplements.<br /> <br /> I also note that there's a *spoilers* no