:17-07:00","id":1464789,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1460837-winter-s-teeth-10-and-crimson-thaw-1-spoilers#post1460837\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I will say the Moritician's Army was a disappointment, though, and will go down in history as the dumbest branch of the Second Inquisition we've seen. The whole fact that they chose to attack at night, even if an hour before dawn, shows that they squandered a massive opportunity. A bunch of cocky sonsabitches who got themselves slaughtered for no good reason. I know there's no story if they attack during the day but smart vampires have an escape route and defenses (or ghouls).</div> </div> </div> </div>If they had attacked in broad daylight my suspension of disbelief would have shattered. We're talking about a massive assault on a giant building in the middle of downtown Saint Paul. With helicopters involved.<br /> The hunters had cops and air traffic control covering for them, but I sincerely doubt that would have worked in the middle of the day.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1631-karthak","name":"Karthak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1631_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-21T14:52:51-07:00","id":1464794,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_contai